  "findings": [
    "All four selected profiles project exact requiredEvidence, targetAuthorities and nonClaims into one request-level model without loss.",
    "Production-v1 Presentation and Document currently have no verify capability-binding registry entry and require a compatibility adapter.",
    "Native-v2 WAVE and PNG resolve through explicit LOCAL_LIVE_PROVEN verify bindings.",
    "Legacy verification result shape and family-verifier result shape differ materially, so EvidenceObservation and StandingDecision are not yet proven common contracts.",
    "No universal execution sequence is required by the provisional request model."
  ],
  "hypothesis": "One evaluation request can bind exact subject identity, profile semantics and one capability reference without requiring one universal workflow sequence.",
  "kind": "artifact-evaluation-model-pressure-test",
  "nextQuestion": "Can gate receipts and delegated family results be normalized into one EvidenceObservation set without weakening either profile boundary?",
